# Placeholder so this directory exists in git.
#
# The real fixtures for the Mini PC baseline at deployed SHA dab261cc are
# captured by docker/cloud-regression/scripts/capture-minipc-baseline.sh
# (one-time operator step — requires SSH to bruce@10.69.31.68 via
# pem/minipc key + reachable ZeroTier link).
#
# Expected fixture files after capture:
#   Caddyfile                       raw /etc/caddy/Caddyfile from Mini PC
#   Caddyfile.normalized            whitespace-stripped variant
#   Caddyfile.normalized.sha256     sha256 of normalized variant
#   livos.service                   /etc/systemd/system/livos.service
#   livos.service.sha256            sha256 of livos.service
#   liv-core.service                /etc/systemd/system/liv-core.service
#   liv-core.service.sha256         sha256
#   liv-worker.service              /etc/systemd/system/liv-worker.service
#   liv-worker.service.sha256       sha256
#   liv-memory.service              /etc/systemd/system/liv-memory.service
#   liv-memory.service.sha256       sha256
#   caddy.service                   /etc/systemd/system/caddy.service
#   caddy.service.sha256            sha256
#   env.shape                       keys only from /opt/livos/.env (no values!)
#   apt-packages.txt                names only from dpkg -l (no versions)
#   deployed-sha.txt                contents of /opt/livos/.deployed-sha
#   captured-at.txt                 ISO-8601 timestamp of capture
#
# Without these fixtures, test-cloud-byte-equivalence.sh runs in NEGATIVE-
# CHECKS-ONLY mode (still asserts AC-104-3 D-104-NO-PROD-IMPACT invariants:
# no pki-global.conf, no dnsmasq config, no local-lan Caddyfile directives;
# AC-104-12: caddy.service enabled).
